        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bengaluru Vijaya \"B.V.\" Radha, Purandara Dasa\n- Works: a 1964 Kannada film\n- Concepts: Geetam\n\nFacts:\n- Purandara Dasa, associated with the music form Geetam, was born on October 13, 1484.\n- Bengaluru Vijaya \"B.V.\" Radha started her career in a 1964 Kannada film.\n- The 1964 Kannada film that began Bengaluru Vijaya \"B.V.\" Radha's career was based on the life of Purandara Dasa.",
